ite_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.5.1.stable, 4.4.1.stable, 4.3.stable\n- Not reproducible in: 4.2.2.stable\n\n### System information\n\nKubuntu 25.04 - Godot v4.5.1.stable\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe editor crashes when attempting to generate a POT file via **Project Settings -> Localization -> POT Generation -> Generate POT**. This issue occurs due to a missing dependency—specifically, a script that was deleted externally.\n\nUsers would expect that the editor handles missing dependencies gracefully by displaying an error message in the Output window, rather than crashing entirely.\n\n\nError message from the console/terminal:\n```\nWARNING: res://faulty_scene.tscn:3 - ext_resource, invalid UID: uid://bt8kj2d7fu1m1 - using text path instead: res://missing_script.gd\n     at: load (scene/resources/resource_format_text.cpp:444)\nERROR: Attempt to open script 'res://missing_script.gd' resulted in error 'File not found'.\n   at: load_source_code (modules/gdscript/gdscript.cpp:1120)\nERROR: Failed loading resource: res://missing_script.gd.\n   at: _load (core/io/resource_loader.cpp:343)\n\n================================================================\nhandle_crash: Program crashed with signal 11\nEngine version: Godot Engine v4.5.1.stable.official (f62fdbde15035c5576dad93e586201f4d41ef0cb)\nDumping the backtrace. Please include this when reporting the bug on: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues\nERROR: FATAL: Index p_index = 1 is out of bounds (size() = 0).\n   at: get (./core/templates/cowdata.h:187)\n```\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nPreperations for a new project:\n- Create a new project, main scene and a second scene; the sceond scene is no child of the main scene\n- Attach a script to one child of the second scene -> save and close the editor\n- Remove the script file outside of the editor using your OS file manager\n- Open the main scene and add the second scene as file source for the POT generation\n\n<img width=\"1206\" height=\"747\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ffcdb46d-ea39-4b06-bd95-9d6e9d09c981\" />\n\n\nExample project after doing the perperations: [pot-generation-crash-example.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23438854/pot-generation-crash-example.zip)\n\nReproduce crash:\n- Click \"Generate POT\" in \"Project Settings -> Localization -> POT Generation\"\n\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[pot-generation-crash-example.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23438854/pot-generation-crash-example.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112578/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repo